{"id":"n62836-2-5","stage":5,"title":"급 · 级","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62836-2-5-1","ko":"다음 주에 검도 승급 심사를 받는다고?","zh":"听说你下周参加剑道升级考核？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주에","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"검도","meaning":"剑道","explanation":"검도：剑道","readings":[{"term":"검도","audio":"/audio/bcb497641dc51f24269f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25126","senseId":"1","lemma":"검도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승급","meaning":"升级，晋级，晋升","explanation":"승급：升级，晋级，晋升","readings":[{"term":"승급","audio":"/audio/161f59d1fa14e859544e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83597","senseId":"1","lemma":"승급","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심사를","meaning":"审查","explanation":"심사：审查；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"심사","audio":"/audio/e5d4b120f28c3201ea69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16442","senseId":"1","lemma":"심사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받는다고?","meaning":"接受，收到","explanation":"받다：接受，收到；는다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"10","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"bcb497641dc51f24","term":"검도","zh":"剑道","audio":"/audio/bcb497641dc51f24269f.mp3","entryId":"25126","definition":"两个人用竹子做的刀打或刺对方以决胜负的比赛。","pronunciation":["검ː도"]},{"id":"161f59d1fa14e859","term":"승급","zh":"升级，晋级，晋升","audio":"/audio/161f59d1fa14e859544e.mp3","entryId":"83597","definition":"级别、等级、职位等上升。","pronunciation":["승급"]},{"id":"e5d4b120f28c3201","term":"심사","zh":"审查","audio":"/audio/e5d4b120f28c3201ea69.mp3","entryId":"16442","definition":"为了分辨好坏而仔细察看。","pronunciation":["심사"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，收到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"遭受某种决定或判决。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f40a7c48ac51a68203bb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62836-2-5-2","ko":"응. 이번에는 꼭 이 급으로 올라가야지.","zh":"嗯，这次一定要升到二级。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번에는","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"급으로","meaning":"级","explanation":"급：级；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"급","audio":"/audio/65e163cd1566937d515b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62836","senseId":"2","lemma":"급","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라